{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Spell Wizard</strong>, you\u2019ll battle hordes of enemies by typing the words associated with them to unleash spells. Precision and speed are your weapons in this fast-paced Typing game with Roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Typing Combat:</strong> Face off against waves of enemies, using your keyboard to strike them down with precision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/M2_SKULLS_ACTION.gif?t=1739196530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Collect gems to enhance your abilities and unlock new upgrades between runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/NEW_STORE_GIF.gif?t=1739196530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short but Intense:</strong> Each run is a  test of skill and survival, perfect for quick gaming sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/M3_YETTI.gif?t=1739196530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill-Driven Gameplay:</strong> A game for every skill level\u2014develop your typing mastery and rise above the horde.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/BOSS_GIF.gif?t=1739196530\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"http